From 7ceb09480f330252215bfcf4e437db2272c4598d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 13:27:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(examples): regenerate the first router part after the
 tabbed contour entry change

Commit ac03087a3 (PR #3684) changed where a tabbed outside 2D Contour
starts its untabbed levels. The committed demo kept the old cached path
of 2D Contour1, so first_router_part failed at the comparison with the
command build.

Regenerated by the documented commands: WRITE_GOLDEN=1 on
first_router_part, then camcraft-cli process for the .nc. The posted
program changes only in the 2D Contour1 section.

Fixes #3698

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
